"Note: When `++*++` is returned as the origin, `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials` is forced to `false` per the CORS specification.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_HTTP_CORS_RETURN_EXACT_ORIGINS+++[]\n"
